 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/match1713702date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">领先降级区热刺2分！西汉姆联客场0-0闷平水晶宫 萨尔进球被吹</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.85" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260421/zhanbao_image_1713702_1776717273_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.85" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.85" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260421/zhanbao_image_1713702_1776717273_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260421/zhanbao_image_1713702_1776717273_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">水晶宫0-0战平西汉姆联，铁锤帮英超2轮不败，领先降级区的热刺2分。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/match1954642date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">挺进决赛！吉达国民2-1逆转神户胜利船 加莱诺+托尼破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260421/202604210231005887.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260421/202604210231005887.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260421/202604210231005887.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">吉达国民2-1逆转神户胜利船，晋级亚冠精英联赛决赛。</span></p><p><strong>【劳伦斯奖颁奖】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e67531b06f9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">六冠王实至名归！官方：巴黎获得劳伦斯世界体育奖年度最佳团队奖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210430199662.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210430199662_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210430199662_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">劳伦斯奖官方今日举行颁奖典礼，官方宣布：巴黎圣日耳曼获得年度最佳团队奖！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e66fc305ab6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">连续两年有斩获！官方：18岁亚马尔获劳伦斯年度最佳青年运动员奖</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e676dd90e3fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亚马尔：能成首位获劳伦斯年度最佳青年运动员奖的人，是一种骄傲</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210229015248.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210229015248.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210229015248.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">巴萨前锋亚马尔获得2026年度最佳青年运动员奖！该奖项于今年首次设立，亚马尔成为首位获奖者。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e6737d8c684native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：36岁前皇马中场托尼·克罗斯获得2026劳伦斯体育启发奖</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e679c92a296native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">克罗斯获奖发言：马德里领奖对我意义重大，我在这找到了一个家</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210243091236.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210243091236_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210243091236_720.jpg"> </div><p>前皇马中场托尼·克罗斯获得2026劳伦斯体育启发奖！该奖项于今年首次设立并颁发，克罗斯是首位获奖者。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e687c65308enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亚马尔：梅西是足球历史最佳也是最伟大运动员 希望追随他的道路</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210408491505_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210408491505_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210408491505_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">在今日凌晨进行的劳伦斯奖颁奖典礼中，巴萨前锋亚马尔荣获首次设立的年度最佳青年运动员奖项。典礼结束后，亚马尔出席了新闻发布会。</span></p><p><strong>【其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e6925e2ba79native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">保级已无理论可能！狼队剩5轮落后第17名16分，提前确认降级英冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210456188383.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210456188383_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210456188383_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">本轮英超进行的最后一场比赛，西汉姆0-0闷平水晶宫取得一分，领先降级区2分。这也意味着英超垫底的狼队提前5轮确认降级至英冠联赛！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e64da025808native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">接替伊劳拉！伯恩茅斯官方：罗泽赛季结束后出任新帅，将签约三年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210001328153.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210001328153.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210001328153.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">伯恩茅斯官方宣布，前莱比锡主帅罗泽下赛季将接替伊劳拉，出任球队新帅，双方将签约三年。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-21/69e66ca831502native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">又一人自由身离队！罗马诺：31岁斯通斯预计本赛季结束后离开曼城</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260421/202604210213281321_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; widt